    "created_at": "2022-03-14T16:58:35Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-03-14T16:58:35Z",
    "body": "I believe that would be a breaking change from Chromium's perspective. Is there any particular reason why Server-Timing should be limited to secure contexts? Any security/privacy issues that arise from the fact that it is not?\r\nAlso, what are the benefits of enforcing this limitation on the Fetch side?",
    "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
